  m_text: 'Torches and braziers flicker and light the room.

    Skulls, bones, cobwebs,
    rubble and banners make it feel lived in (or died in).

    <size=80%><color=#C9B98F>Prefabs:
    Torch_Wall, Brazier_Standing, Skull, Bones_Pile, Cobweb, Rubble_Pile, Banner_Wall,
    Sign_StonePlaque</color></size>'
