  m_text: 'AND: both levers on. OR: either lever on. NOT: lever A off.

    The AND
    stone opens the door. The braziers show OR and NOT.

    <size=80%><color=#C9B98F>Prefabs:
    Runestone_AND, Runestone_OR, Runestone_NOT, Lever_Wall, Indicator_Brazier</color></size>'
